WEBVTT

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.630
I've had more opportunities to hang out with Sensei
since summer break started...

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:20.420
But instead, it's like things feel kinda awkward...

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:26.920
She's still cheerful around me the same as always,
but it's like she's somewhat different than before...

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.750
What's up with wearing your uniform?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.500
I started writing my novel for the club publication,
but I've hit a wall, so...

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.130
I thought I'd go to the clubroom
and borrow a book for reference.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:40.170
Huh...

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.830
Oh hey, did you by any chance take my underwear?

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.040
Huh?!

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:49.500
Mine are the only ones missing from the ones
that were hanging out to dry.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.080
A-as if I'd take them! Search the yard!

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.670
Jeez, the NORMAL thing
is to not suspect me immediately...

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.920
Then what was that thing from the other day about...?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.630
Uh... if you're free, want to come with me?

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.960
We could grab a coffee or something
at L'Amant on the way back, too.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.960
That's all right. I don't particularly have a reason to.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.710
As for reference books,
the ones I have on hand are enough.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.500
Why don't you go by yourself?

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.250
Mijuku mujou saredo

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.250
Inexperienced, heartless, but even so,

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:28.410
Utsukushiku are

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:28.410
Be beautiful

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:39.370
No Destiny fusawashiku nai

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:39.370
No Destiny, unworthy

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.330
Konnanja kitto monotarinai

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.330
If it's like this, then probably things will go well

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.420
You okay...?

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.420
Did something happen...?

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.420
I'll...

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.420
Be waiting for you...

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.160
Kurai katattokeba umaku iku

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.160
If we just talk as if it's never enough

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.410
Mono, kane, ai, koto,

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.410
Things, money, love, words,

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.160
Mou jikokenji akita

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.160
I'm tired of self-asserting myself already

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.250
I got here before you.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.250
I have the correct meeting place, right?

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.250
Did something happen? You okay?

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.370
Déjà vu nani ga sonna fuman nanda?

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.370
Déjà vu, what are you so unsatisfied about?

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:56.120
Sanzan wagamama katattoite

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:56.120
You've said all sorts of selfish things,

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.040
Kore ijou hoka ni nani ga iru?

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.040
what more could you possibly want?

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.830
Sonna tokoro mo warito kirai ja nai

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.830
I kind of don't mind that about you

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.460
Mou "kiki akitanda yo sono serifu"

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.460
Honestly, "I'm sick of hearing that line"

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:12.250
Chuuto hanpa dake ha iya

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:12.250
The one thing I don't want is ambiguousness

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.000
Mou ii aa shite kou shite ittetatte

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.000
Enough. Even if you say to do this or that,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.870
Aishite doushite? iwaretatte

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.870
Even if you say love me, or why?

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.660
Asobi dakenara kantan de

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.660
It's easy if it's just for fun

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.460
Shinken koushou muchakucha de

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.460
And that it's reckless serious negotiating

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:23.790
Omoi mo shinai omoi kotoba

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:23.790
How many times are those worn out unexpectedly

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.870
Nando tsukai furusu noka?

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.870
Serious words going to be used?

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.960
Douse kitai shitetanda deki race demo

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.960
We were hoping anyway, even if it was a fixed race,

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.580
Inyou darake no phrase mo

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.580
Even all those quoted phrases,

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:36.210
Kakato mochiagaru kotoba taboo ni shite

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:36.210
Making backtracking words taboo

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:40.330
Kuuki wo yonda ame furanaide yo

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:40.330
Take a hint, don't let it rain

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:43.080
Domestic Girlfriend

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.130
A woman's mind... I don't get it.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.210
Usually, after doing something like that,
aren't they more affectionate?

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:00.130
No, it's probably wrong to expect "normal" from her...

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:02.330
Huh?

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:03.960
Whoa!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.210
Ow...

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.710
Huh?!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.830
A bike?! Inside the school?!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.330
My life sucks!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.130
Uh...

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.710
Second-year?!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.000
Y-yeah...?

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:27.040
Woo-hoo! Same here! Same here!
Classmates! I'm Alex! And you?

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.170
Uh... I'm Fujii.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:33.540
Nah, not that. First name. I'm Al.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.250
Natsuo...

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.420
Nat-chan! Nice to meetcha!

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.380
CAFÉ

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.380
L'AMANT

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:47.290
Oh my, what a pretty-faced doll.
A friend of yours, Natsuo-chan?

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:51.170
Not exactly a friend... He apparently lived overseas
and has now transferred to my school.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:53.790
And I'm not a doll. Hi there!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.710
I'm an American-made stud of Japanese descent.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.130
I see. An idiot has arrived in Japan...

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.710
Hey Boss, will somewhere around here do...?

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.000
Okay~!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.330
What's that for? Is it an announcement
for a festival or something?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.210
That's not it. You see, it's a request from the police.

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:13.040
Apparently, an underwear thief has hit this area
repeatedly recently. That's a warning notice poster.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.630
An underwear thief?

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:20.040
So, he's one of those proverbial "hentai" guys!
I'd heard of them over where I was, too.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.790
What is it about underwear that turns them on
when it's not even being worn by someone?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.580
If no one's wearing them, they're just cloth.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.920
You say that like you're a chick magnet.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:30.710
Well, you know, life overseas was all smiles for me.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.710
Then what were the names and ages
of all your girlfriends up until now?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.000
He's lying...

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:43.210
Nat-chan, you have a girlfriend?

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:46.790
Huh? Me? I... don't have one right now, but...

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.330
I see. Well, they do say that Japanese people are shy.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.830
Actually, it depends on the person.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.750
I have both guy and girl friends
who are pretty assertive, so...

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.790
Huh? Girls, too? Cool! That's cool!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.330
Introduce them to me! You know, once school starts, I...

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:04.210
H-hey, look! Isn't he that underwear thief?!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.130
Let's catch him!

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:06.830
What?!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.330
That street...!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.380
Hey! Hold it!

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.630
Don't let him get away, Nat-chan!

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.750
Say your prayers!

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.420
Mission complete!

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:36.040
Didn't you see that I was behind him...?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.920
Do you think we'll be on the news?

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.920
I don't know, over something like an underwear thief...

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:45.170
I was shocked to hear you say
that you were at the police station.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:49.670
I thought I should at least clear myself
of the false accusation from lunchtime today.

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:50.750
And this person?

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.580
Huh? Oh... I kinda got acquainted with him at school...

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.210
Hey, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.130
Um, and you are...?

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:00.750
Oh, I'm the one that might have fell victim today...

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:01.630
I see.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:05.580
Well, we can't return anything to you yet,
but would you mind checking to see if yours are here?

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.380
Sure.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:09.670
Nat-chan, Nat-chan! Who's she?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.420
Oh, um... a friend, I guess?

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.630
She's really cute...!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:19.580
I wanna go out with that girl!
Nat-chan, introduce me to her!

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.670
So, were yours there after all?

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.170
Yeah, they were.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:31.210
Since they're evidence, apparently it'll be
quite a while before they get returned.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:35.040
It seems like he'd stolen quite a lot just today,
so there were a lot lined up.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:40.080
They were mostly relatively small sizes, so it looks
like the suspect had pedophilic tendencies.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.500
Nat-chan, introduce me to her!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.330
I wonder how I feel... about Rui...

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.540
An underwear thief?!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.290
And you caught him, Natsuo-kun?!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.170
Were you okay? He didn't attack you back
or anything like that...?

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:01.750
Yes, I'm fine. I was also with a well-built guy, so...

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.710
I see. Thank goodness...

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.540
Just as I thought... She's somewhat different than before.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.000
If this had been like before...

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:14.040
It's already this late?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.500
We gotta hurry and make dinner.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:26.330
So... you know the guy that I was with today?
His name's Alex and...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.250
The next time you're free, wanna go hang out with him,
like the three of us together?

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:33.290
Huh? Why? He's your friend, right?

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.920
Well, yeah, but...

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:40.170
Uh, that is... Apparently Al's interested in you.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.880
I mean, he doesn't seem like a bad guy, so...

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:48.750
So, you're... trying to set me up... with that guy...?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.500
Hey...!

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.790
Come in...

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.580
I made yaki-udon... You want some...?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.000
It's good...

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.960
So, I'm sorry about earlier.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.290
For saying something insensitive...

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.540
Even though I was asked,
it's not something that I should've said-

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.580
If you're going to apologize...

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.790
isn't there something you should be doing?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:27.960
Sorry.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.000
I don't... really mind...

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.000
KEIGO HIGASHINO

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.000
FATE

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.790
Sorry... I'll come back later...

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.460
Sensei, wait!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.540
Please wait!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.460
It's not what it looks like!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.460
What then?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.710
Sorry. My thoughts are all over the place.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:19.000
Right now, no matter what you say,
I wouldn't be able to believe you...

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.670
Hina-nee, I'm coming in.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:39.750
I figure you would probably want to have a talk with me.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:42.080
You know me all too well...

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.830
Just now... which one of you...?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.750
Me. I'm the one who initiated things.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.040
What do you mean?!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.670
You know, I think I might like him.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:10:59.830
Rui...

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:04.460
Rui, what're you saying?!
You know that Natsuo-kun is our family!

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.040
Do you think that it's okay
to have that kind of relationship?!

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:11.500
But it's not like we're related by blood or anything.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.460
Rui... I get your point of view.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:20.540
But...

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.170
I think that Mom would be sad...

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.880
No way! She said no?!

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:46.210
I underestimated the shyness of Japanese girls...

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:51.500
But I won't give up! We're at the same school,
so there'll be plenty of chances, right?!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.670
Y-yeah...

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.540
Nat-chan, you seem particularly down today.
Did something happen?

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:01.540
Right now, things are strained within my family and...

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.830
the future's kinda uncertain.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.130
A fight?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.580
Well, something like that...

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.380
Did you talk things out properly?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.130
That's not good, you know?

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:18.710
It seems like conveying your point without talking
is considered a good thing in Japan but...

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.960
You can't tell the other person's feelings
if you don't ask them.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:27.380
They can't tell yours if you don't tell them. Am I right?

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.290
Then Al, you should go talk to Rui in person too-

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.710
That's one thing. This is another.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.540
You're there, right?

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:52.960
You don't have to open the door,
please just listen. About yesterday-

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.540
Rui started it, right?

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:59.630
I heard it from Rui...
About her feelings and her point of view.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.380
Natsuo-kun, what about you?

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.880
What about me?

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:07.750
Do you like Rui?

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:18.210
My feelings... haven't changed at all
since you and I went to the beach, Sensei...

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.670
Then, why...?!

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.210
I'm...

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.290
going to move out of this house...

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.460
To live by yourself all of a sudden...

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.290
You're not by any chance against our remarriage-

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.170
No, not at all! I'm all for it!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:47.880
I'd always had a desire from before to become
independent, but I was worried about Mom and Rui.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:51.380
But I can relax now that you guys
are with them, Fujii-san.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:55.580
It'll be lonelier, but you're now a respectable
adult member of society after all.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:56.830
Hina-nee...

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.210
Is it my fault?

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:07.380
We might as well go somewhere together
while Hina-san is still here...

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:08.250
I know!

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:12.290
There's going to be a pre-festival vigil on Saturday
at the shrine in the heart of the shopping district.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.710
Shall we all go together?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.170
Wow! It's quite the turnout!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:36.000
What do you think? About Hina-nee...

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:40.920
Part of the reason for her moving out
is definitely because of us, right...?

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.210
Well... yeah.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:48.790
I wasn't really thinking too carefully while doing it,
but we should probably hold off for a while, right?

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:49.670
The kissing...

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.540
Yeah, I suppose so...

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.670
Oh, that person there.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.420
I'm pretty sure she's from L'Amant...

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.000
Ayano-san!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.710
Oh! Natsuo-kun and Rui-Rui-chan! You guys came too.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.130
Your son?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.000
Yep!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.420
How old are you?

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.170
You're five, huh?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.750
Introduce yourself properly, Youta.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.170
Hurry!

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:17.130
I was thinking that I have to also show my son
the manager's gallant figure today.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:18.460
The manager's?

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:22.250
The businesses in the shopping district
each take turns, so for this year... Look!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.210
Huh?!

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.000
Oh, hey, Natsuo-chan!

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.170
What's with that getup...?

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:32.790
Since you made it here, might as well dance! Dance!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.290
GOLDFISH SCOOPING

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.330
Goldfish scooping!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.170
You'll probably take a while,
so we're going to go look around at other things.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.250
Call my cell phone when you're done.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.290
Okay!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.790
Lady, you're awesome!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:55.170
46 of them with one scoop...!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.580
And now we catch and release.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.540
What?! What a waste!

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.710
I'll give them out to any kid who wants any.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.960
Excuse me, may I have some bags-

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:15.710
Sensei.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:18.750
Natsuo-kun...

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:22.210
What a relief! My cell phone broke
and I didn't know what I was going to do...

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.330
The crowds. We'll get separated, so...

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:45.580
This is... the back of the shrine?
Where are Mom and the others?

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.380
Can we talk, just the two of us?

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:53.000
Sensei, the reason why you're moving out
of the house is definitely because of me, right?

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:58.790
Based on my timing of when I said I was moving out,
I don't blame you for taking it that way. I'm sorry.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:04.250
I'd been thinking of maybe doing it for a while.
And that's turned out to be now, that's all.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.000
So, don't feel like you're responsible, okay?

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:14.460
Sensei... when you're being evasive, do you know
that you look down to the side when you talk?

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:17.710
If it's my fault, then please reconsider
something like living by yourself.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.670
I won't do that kinda thing with Rui anymore and...

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:24.130
I'll make every effort not to act
so obvious around you, Sensei.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.290
If I do anything that offends you, I'll fix it, so...!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.500
That's not it.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:33.420
This is for your sake, Natsuo-kun,
and something that's necessary for my own sake too...

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:35.500
What do you mean, "something that's necessary"...?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.330
Hey, Sensei?! Please wait!

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.330
This conversation's not over yet!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.670
I'm sorry. There's nothing left to talk about.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:45.790
What's with that?!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.540
You know, I haven't heard a reason from you yet!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.170
Stop it. Let me go.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.830
What were you offended by?

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.080
I said let go! Really, I've had enough!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.500
I'm not letting go! Not while we're angry with each other-

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.130
Ow! You bit... What?!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.330
Sensei! Come on, please wait!

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:08.580
Leave me alone!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.880
If I was rude to you, then I'll apologize!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:15.330
It's not like I want you to apologize!
I'm just not in that kind of mood to-

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.250
Oh, you're...

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.960
Sir, please get a hold of her!

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:20.880
Like this?

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:21.670
Noooooo!
Like this?

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:22.380
Noooooo!

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.460
Natsuo-kun, what's going on?

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:29.420
Well, we were in the middle of a conversation,
but she like suddenly got angry and...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.420
"Suddenly"?

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:34.960
Oh my, it's true.
Darlin', your face looks extremely ugly right now.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.630
It's always been ugly.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.580
That's not... Well, maybe.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:46.080
Honestly, what're you doing,
troubling this tender young lad? Aren't you the adult?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.130
You should face him properly.

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:50.830
Even adults have things they can't stand.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.710
And I'm sayin' that's where the adult
needs to be accommodating!

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.460
Shame on you for acting this way towards a young man.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:57.170
Then I don't have to be an adult!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:58.040
You being a spoiled brat?!

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:01.330
Boss, it's unusual that you'd have this much trouble.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:04.460
She's so stubborn! It's like she's a child or an old person!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:08.330
It's hard to think she was having
an illicit love affair up until recently.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.630
I don't think that matters.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:15.460
When you feel all "grr!"
licking candy makes it a little better.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.580
Th-thanks...

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.000
Taste good?

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:29.750
Yeah...

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:37.130
It looks like she's calmed down somewhat.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.290
The rest is up to the two of you to get along.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.540
Listen, okay? At times like this, once she starts talking,

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.380
you let her get it all out
without arguing or asking questions.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.880
Then she'll feel better and will be back to normal.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.290
Well, good luck!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.080
Rui...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.790
has been a free spirit since she was little,
and I've always been a little jealous.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:05.000
I felt strongly that I had to "keep it together," so I often
acted based on the situation or sensing the mood.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:09.920
But, despite Rui being kind of awkward,
she had a firm grasp on her own identity.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.420
Lucky... I thought it'd be nice
if I could become like that, too.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.210
That's my reason for moving out.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.920
When I saw the two of you kissing...

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:25.580
more than being worried that our family
would fall apart, my jealousy took over...

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.710
If I stayed any longer with you,
I wouldn't be able to hold back my feelings.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:32.330
I thought that I had to leave before that happened.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.290
Sensei... that's...

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:40.960
Something like this... Natsuo-kun, you might think,
"But you're the one who rejected me," but...

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:42.750
I had no choice...!

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:46.380
As an adult, I can't do things like Rui can...!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:49.880
I kept telling myself that no, I can't, but...

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:55.000
I walked a dimly lit street with my head down,

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:52.670
it's getting harder and harder to lie to myself and...

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:58.670
Without a destination

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.960
Wh-what...?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:02.290
I'm sorry... It's just that I feel like this is the
first time I got to hear your true feelings, Sensei.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:07.500
When I met you, as you were looking up at the sky,

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:07.170
On top of that, they were so unexpected
and that makes me so happy that I can't help but laugh.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.710
What's with you?!

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.920
It was simply mystifying

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:11.420
And here I am, trying to get it all out!
Fine, I've had enough!

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:17.420
Why look at an empty sky?

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:12.290
Wait!

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.330
Natsuo-kun...

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.040
You don't have to respond at all.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:23.210
I realized by being with you,

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.170
I don't expect anything.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:22.920
So, it's okay if I think this way, right...?

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.000
That you and I, Sensei, love each other.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:28.250
That I was looking down,

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:32.330
Instead of answering, please let us stay like this
for a little while longer.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:35.710
Probably because I was overthinking things

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.630
Just like this...

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:36.710
For a little while longer.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:41.330
I'm always here for you

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:47.000
Even if the light disappears,

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:51.210
The two of us, let's keep holding hands

00:21:51.380 --> 00:22:01.380
If we could keep the tiniest of hope alive and love,

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.000
We won't be afraid

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:09.460
If we're in separate places and it gets painful,

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:11.540
Remember,

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:21.420
Even if you lose that world,

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:27.380
I'll be right here waiting

00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:36.790
I'm always here for you

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:42.420
Even if the light disappears,

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:46.630
The two of us, let's keep holding hands

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:56.630
If we could keep the tiniest of hope alive and love,

00:22:56.630 --> 00:23:00.750
We won't be afraid

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:11.880
I'm always here for you

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:16.670
Now that was fun!

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:18.670
That was the first time in a while that we got to relax.

00:23:18.670 --> 00:23:20.330
Yes, indeed!

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:42.920
Episode 9

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:42.920
Don't Say That, Please?

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:41.210
Don't say that, please?
